# Keep AI/agent indexing on the CANONICAL checkout only.
#
# .claude/worktrees/ holds git worktrees from past Claude Code sessions —
# full snapshots of the repo at OLDER commits. An external agent that indexes
# them reads a stale codebase and reports it as current (this happened:
# the 2026-07-03 antipattern audit measured file sizes and routes from a
# months-old worktree and produced 3-5x wrong numbers). Git already ignores
# .claude/ via .gitignore; this file extends that to Cursor's indexer.
.claude/
.next/
node_modules/
